{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o094b","title":"审荣开城与审配被杀","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o094b-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操示袁尚印绶动摇守军，审荣夜开邺东门，审配战败被擒杀，邺城平定。","evidence":["wudi-e-o094b-q"]},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o062a-account","label":"《董二袁刘传第六》正文","text":"审荣开东门曹操军擒审配审配不屈被斩","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o062a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"攻取","evidence":["wudi-e-o094b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0217","role":"开门纳兵","evidence":["wudi-e-o094b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0208","role":"战败被杀","evidence":["wudi-e-o094b-q"]}],"place":{"text":"邺","evidence":["wudi-e-o094b-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安九年八月","year":204,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o094b-q","wudi-q-o092","wudi-q-b-6787e3ddd3e334b677d4"],"chronology":"wudi-y204","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o092","basis":"建安九年八月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,509,"O094b"],"order":222}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0208","name":"审配","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0217","name":"审荣","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o062a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-9ef4a6a43345fdbec3b4","layer":"original","quote":"配兄子荣，守东门，夜开门纳太祖兵；与配战城中，生擒配。配声气壮烈，终无挠辞〖15〗，见者莫不叹息。遂斩之。﹝四﹞","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":343,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o094b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-93dd6c920a0f23a3c9ea","layer":"original","quote":"得尚印绶、节、钺〖15〗，使尚降人示其家。城中崩沮〖16〗。八月，审配兄子荣，夜开所守城东门，纳兵。配逆战，败，生擒配。斩之，邺定。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":508,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":182,"end":248,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-6787e3ddd3e334b677d4","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-6787e3ddd3e334b677d4","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗九年：建安九年（公元 204）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":510,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c8fff97bafc82c655f3f","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o092","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-3e549c423b15df48398a","layer":"original","quote":"九年春正月〖1〗，济河，遏淇水入白沟以通粮道〖2〗。二月，尚复攻谭，留苏由、审配守邺〖3〗。公进军到洹水〖4〗，由降；既至，攻邺，为土山、地道。武安长尹楷屯毛城〖5〗，通上党粮道〖6〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":506,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":93,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
